OL,3,ALucy Letby inquiry to publish findings
OL,4,Ainto how nurse was able to murder seven
OL,5,Ababies
OL,6,
OL,7,FA public inquiry into how Lucy Letby
OL,8,Fwas able to murder seven babies will
OL,9,Fpublish its findings later - here's a
OL,10,Freminder of Letby's crimes
OL,12,FLetby, now 36, is serving 15 whole-life
OL,13,Fprison terms. She was convicted in 2023
OL,14,Fand has been denied permission to
OL,15,Fappeal against her convictions twice
OL,17,FThe Thirlwall Inquiry was commissioned
OL,18,Fby the government to explore how the
OL,19,FCountess of Chester Hospital - where
OL,20,FLetby worked as a neonatal nurse -
OL,21,Fhandled concerns about her conduct
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
